    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65674" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθῠσος</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drunk with wine</i>, prop. only fem., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθυσος Ἀμαζών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hecat.
					34
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθύση γραῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					555
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				1402
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later also,
			of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθύσους τοὺς ἐμπόρους ποιεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					67.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				384
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				23.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				5.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.195
			</span></i>; <i>drunken, intemperate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ceb.
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				330c
			</span></i>.</div>
